---
import Icon from './SideworkIcon.astro';
---
<section class="sw-panel sw-composer" id="editor" aria-labelledby="editor-title" hidden>
  <div class="sw-composer-heading"><div><h2 id="editor-title">Tell the story.</h2><p>A repository shows the code. You explain why it matters.</p></div><button type="button" class="sw-button" id="cancel-project">Back to projects</button></div>
  <div class="sw-composer-layout">
    <form id="project-form" class="sw-story-form">
      <label for="draft-name">Project name<input id="draft-name" name="name" required maxlength="60" autocomplete="off"/></label>
      <label for="draft-tagline">The short version <span>Name the main task someone can do with it.</span><input id="draft-tagline" name="tagline" maxlength="120" placeholder="Customize and share your shell prompt."/></label>
      <label for="draft-description">What does it do? <span>Explain the problem it solves and how it works.</span><textarea id="draft-description" name="description" maxlength="280" rows="3" required></textarea></label>
      <div class="sw-form-grid">
        <label for="draft-category">Category<select id="draft-category" name="category"><option value="">Not set yet</option></select></label>
        <label for="draft-software-type">Software type<select id="draft-software-type" name="softwareType"><option value="">Not set yet</option></select></label>
      </div>
      <label for="draft-audience">Who is it for? <span>Optional. Describe the person or task it helps.</span><input id="draft-audience" name="audience" maxlength="180" placeholder="People who use Zsh, Bash, or PowerShell."/></label>
      <label for="draft-features">What can someone do with it? <span>Optional. Up to five features, one per line. 160 characters per feature.</span><textarea id="draft-features" name="features" rows="4" maxlength="804" placeholder="Preview prompt colors before applying them.&#10;Export a theme as a Markdown file."></textarea></label>
      <label for="draft-url">Project or demo URL<input id="draft-url" name="url" type="url" required maxlength="2048" placeholder="https://example.com"/></label>
      <div class="sw-form-grid"><label for="draft-stage">Where is it now?<select id="draft-stage" name="stage"><option value="">Choose a stage</option><option value="exploring">Exploring</option><option value="building">Building</option><option value="shipped">Shipped</option><option value="paused">Paused</option></select></label><label for="draft-stack">Built with<input id="draft-stack" name="stack" maxlength="80" placeholder="TypeScript · Astro"/></label></div>
      <details class="sw-story-details"><summary>Screenshot & source <Icon name="plus" size={16}/></summary><label for="draft-image">Screenshot URL <span>Use a public HTTPS image link.</span><input id="draft-image" name="image" type="url" maxlength="2048" placeholder="https://…/screenshot.jpg"/></label><label for="draft-image-alt">Describe the screenshot<input id="draft-image-alt" name="imageAlt" maxlength="180" placeholder="What can someone see in this image?"/></label><label for="draft-source">Source code URL<input id="draft-source" name="source" type="url" maxlength="2048" placeholder="https://github.com/you/project"/></label></details>
      <details class="sw-story-details"><summary>Behind the build <Icon name="plus" size={16}/></summary><label for="draft-why">Why I built it<textarea id="draft-why" name="whyBuilt" maxlength="1200" rows="4" placeholder="What problem, question, or small obsession started this?"></textarea></label><label for="draft-learned">What I learned<textarea id="draft-learned" name="learned" maxlength="1200" rows="4" placeholder="A useful discovery, a hard decision, or something you would do differently."></textarea></label></details>
      <p class="sw-composer-error" id="draft-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
      <div class="sw-draft-save"><button type="submit" class="sw-button sw-primary" id="save-project">Save draft <Icon name="arrow" size={16}/></button><p id="draft-save-note" role="status">Saved only in this browser. Your public profile stays unchanged.</p></div>
    </form>
    <aside class="sw-composer-preview" aria-label="Project preview"><div class="sw-preview-heading"><h3>Project preview</h3><span>Private draft</span></div><div id="project-preview"></div></aside>
  </div>
</section>
